{"id":"io5jsvyvsrxybadxuezmwy6ju","title":"杜博娃与刘等在《皇家学会开放科学》揭示科学家对科学本质的认知分歧","originalTitle":"What is science? Even scientists can't agree","summary":"杜博娃与刘等在《皇家学会开放科学》发表研究，揭示科学家对科学本质的认知存在显著分歧：部分认为科学是客观真理的探索，部分强调人类判断与创造力。公众认知更接近物理学家和生物学家。研究指出AI自动化可能强化单一科学方法论，建议跨学科合作需重视多元认知框架。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-science-scientists.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T22:20:25.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T22:22:20.580Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T22:22:20.580Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":51,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"6af71b92-d0fc-443c-a4bf-8afcb3f6b6df","title":"杜博娃与刘等研究揭示科学本质认知分歧及AI影响"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"6af71b92-d0fc-443c-a4bf-8afcb3f6b6df","title":"杜博娃与刘等研究揭示科学本质认知分歧及AI影响"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f_TPuuPnWCW4","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}